{
  "id": "dialogue.mano.afterglow",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "いつかの気持ち",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.afterglow",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.afterglow",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？我也去？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……是的，一不小心就……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇哇……因为和制作人在一起的机会变多了，就自己以为……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "以为我们会一直在一起……我这个人，真是的……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，是这样啊。那，一起出门吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "诶，可以吗……您其实很忙吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只有随时都能做的文书工作而已。有想去的地方吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "谢谢您！那个……制作人觉得哪里好？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "去公园吧",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "去商场吧",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "去百货商店的楼顶吧",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，今天的拍摄结束了。真乃，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "嗯，今天因为是外景，很开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那今天的课和工作都结束了，早点回去休息吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好的……不过，那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "今天天气特别好，我还想在太阳底下动一动身体……",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "所以，可以先不回去，在外面转转吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……嗯，这倒没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "谢谢！那，我们走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "去公园吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不过走过去有点距离吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我没关系的。走了很多路，从太阳那里得到了精神。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那就好……哦，鸽子聚过来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼呼……你们好呀，鸽子先生。大家也很精神呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-06"
      },
      "2-06": {
        "id": "2-06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那就在那边的长椅上和鸽子一起休息吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-07"
      },
      "2-07": {
        "id": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在公园里慢慢待着也不错。难怪真乃常来公园。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-08"
      },
      "2-08": {
        "id": "2-08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "今天特别是……有制作人在，我很安心。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-09"
      },
      "2-09": {
        "id": "2-09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？那以后偶尔也一起来公园吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-10"
      },
      "2-10": {
        "id": "2-10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "真的吗……很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-11"
      },
      "2-11": {
        "id": "2-11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没事吧，真乃？声音听起来快睡着了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-12"
      },
      "2-12": {
        "id": "2-12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼……呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-13"
      },
      "2-13": {
        "id": "2-13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（睡着了吗。辛苦了，真乃。）"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "去商场吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "太好了！这一带有很多可爱的店哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你常来买东西？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的。看衣服、看和鸟有关的小东西……喜欢在各个店里慢慢逛。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那今天我就陪你逛。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-06"
      },
      "3-06": {
        "id": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "诶，但是……我买东西要花很多时间的哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-07"
      },
      "3-07": {
        "id": "3-07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "所以逛街的时候，我总是一个人。和别人一起的话，会担心让人家等太久……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-08"
      },
      "3-08": {
        "id": "3-08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那最近呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-09"
      },
      "3-09": {
        "id": "3-09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-10"
      },
      "3-10": {
        "id": "3-10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当了偶像之后，同伴多了吧。不会和事务所的大家一起去吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-11"
      },
      "3-11": {
        "id": "3-11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "啊，说起来……最近有时会被巡邀。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-12"
      },
      "3-12": {
        "id": "3-12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "虽然有点担心会不会让她等……但是非常开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-13"
      },
      "3-13": {
        "id": "3-13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。巡一定也是觉得开心才邀你的。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-14"
      },
      "3-14": {
        "id": "3-14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "和真乃在一起，我也很开心。所以不用那么客气。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-15"
      },
      "3-15": {
        "id": "3-15",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "既然制作人这么说……其实，我有一家想去的店。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-16"
      },
      "3-16": {
        "id": "3-16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那我们现在就去吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-17"
      },
      "3-17": {
        "id": "3-17",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好的，请多指教！"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "去百货商店的楼顶吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "阳光正好，风也很舒服。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——哦，好像要开始英雄秀了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼呼……孩子们看起来好开心。英雄真受欢迎。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-06"
      },
      "4-06": {
        "id": "4-06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃也能成为孩子们喜欢的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-07"
      },
      "4-07": {
        "id": "4-07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇？我……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-08"
      },
      "4-08": {
        "id": "4-08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "孩子们不只是喜欢英雄，也喜欢偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-09"
      },
      "4-09": {
        "id": "4-09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃呢？小时候喜欢偶像吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-10"
      },
      "4-10": {
        "id": "4-10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "小时候看过的偶像……是的！轻飘飘、亮闪闪的，我很喜欢。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-11"
      },
      "4-11": {
        "id": "4-11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "带着和真乃一样心情的孩子，一定还有。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-12"
      },
      "4-12": {
        "id": "4-12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是这样吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-13"
      },
      "4-13": {
        "id": "4-13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃只要珍惜小时候的心情，这次把梦想送给大家就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-14"
      },
      "4-14": {
        "id": "4-14",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……呼哇。如果我的歌和舞，能传到谁那里的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-15"
      },
      "4-15": {
        "id": "4-15",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我会加油的！嗯！"
      }
    }
  },
